<title>USA: Cherry Corp Q1 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Cherry Corp Q1 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WAUKEGAN, Ill. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statements of Earnings	   Three Months Ended May 31,</p>
<p>  (In thousands except share data)	    1997	  1996</p>
